Hey! Check this out — just got back from the 5,000-cycle stress run and it's flawless 🎉 The telemetry watchdog with adaptive fallback handles everything I've thrown at it. 

```c
while (1) {
    if (telemetry_backlog > WATERMARK) {
        timeout = ADAPTIVE_FALLBACK;
        drop_frame = 1;
    }
    if (hw_wdg_timer_elapsed()) {
        pet_hw_watchdog();
    }
    if (timeout && !drop_frame) {
        send_health_packet();
    }
    drop_frame = 0;
}
```

Clean, tight, handles pressure beautifully! Our flight-readiness review is today and this module basically decides my promotion to Lead Flight Software Engineer. So... you're seeing this, right? This is flight-ready? 🔥
